{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BugSquash is an extermination simulator where you play as a professional Bug Squasher! Clients reach out to you with their pest problems, and you'll respond to increasingly challenging infestations. With each successful job, you'll earn money to upgrade and expand your equipment and take on bigger, badder bugs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose Your Contracts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/f0208bbb77c146afba4cf9f196fda151.poster.avif?t=1765073878\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/f0208bbb77c146afba4cf9f196fda151.webm?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/f0208bbb77c146afba4cf9f196fda151.mp4?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the jobs you want to take on. Larger contracts offer bigger payouts, while smaller ones provide a safer bet for full payment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Earn Money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/e51751906cb15ce0767eed5ad46d0de4.poster.avif?t=1765073878\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/e51751906cb15ce0767eed5ad46d0de4.webm?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/e51751906cb15ce0767eed5ad46d0de4.mp4?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jobs to earn money. if you do your job well, you might even receive extra tips or bonuses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Buy New Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/a38d34b4e10db0e43dec969ebb4d42f0.poster.avif?t=1765073878\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/a38d34b4e10db0e43dec969ebb4d42f0.webm?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/a38d34b4e10db0e43dec969ebb4d42f0.mp4?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your toolkit with powerful equipment like the Sound Amplifier, perfect for detecting movement through walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade Your Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/72a4ca9104ead2f910afe675d48d6379.poster.avif?t=1765073878\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/72a4ca9104ead2f910afe675d48d6379.webm?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/72a4ca9104ead2f910afe675d48d6379.mp4?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your earnings to enhance your gear and eliminate bugs more efficiently.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Squash Every Bug</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/bf490d99303741d4cdd83d7059952a74.poster.avif?t=1765073878\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/bf490d99303741d4cdd83d7059952a74.webm?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/bf490d99303741d4cdd83d7059952a74.mp4?t=1765073878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a variety of bugs, each requiring a unique approach to take them down effectively.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522470?t=1765073878","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522470?t=1765073878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/7da52fb155d2f182864b46b36c745778dc4884e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765073878","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/7da52fb155d2f182864b46b36c745778dc4884e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765073878","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BugSquash is an extermination simulator where you play as a professional Bug Squasher! Clients reach out to you with their pest problems, and you'll respond to increasingly challenging infestations. With each successful job, you'll earn money to upgrade and expand your equipment and take on bigger, badder bugs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: